          "formattedCitation": "<div class=\"csl-entry\">\u00c2li, Mustafa bin Ahmet. <i>K\u00fcnh\u00fc\u2019l-ahb\u00e2r: (tenkitli metin)</i>. Edited by Suat Donuk and Derya \u00d6rs. 1. bask\u0131. 5 vols. T\u00fcrkiye Yazma Eserler Kurumu Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 yay\u0131nlar\u0131. Fatih, \u0130stanbul: T\u00fcrkiye Yazma Eserler Kurumu Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131, 2020. https://ekitap.yek.gov.tr/urun/kunhu%E2%80%99l-ahbar--takim-5-cilt-_821.aspx.</div>",
